  "next_step": "Trace how a local split/merge changes candidate-visible text and final evidence before proposing new supervision; remain offline and do not reopen closed packing variants on the same two questions.",
  "research_consequences": [
    "A document-only student needs an explicitly defined query-distribution utility target and treatment of conflicting preferences.",
    "A query-conditioned post-retrieval editor would require an explicit question input, action timing, fixed source domain and evidence-output contract.",
    "Existing standalone relevance labels do not identify local edit utility; identical rendered evidence cannot support a distinct output-based utility label."
  ],
